  "description": "<p data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"435\">Trek door de melkweg en neem het op tegen buitenaardse dreigingen in <strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"237\">Destiny</strong> voor de PS4. Deze online shooter van Bungie combineert snelle actie met RPG-elementen en biedt talloze missies, co-op gameplay en PvP-modus. De disc is getest en werkt perfect – inclusief garantie.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"701\">\r\n<li data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"492\">\r\n<p data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"492\">🌌 Sci-fi shooter met RPG-elementen en loot-systeem</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"558\">\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"558\">🎮 Speel solo, co-op of in multiplayer tegen andere Guardians</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"614\">🛡️ Kies uit drie klassen: Hunter, Warlock of Titan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"669\">🚀 Strijd op planeten zoals de Maan, Mars en Venus</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"701\">\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"701\">📦 Originele hoes meegeleverd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"730\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"985\">Platform: <strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"758\">PlayStation 4</strong><br data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"761\">Genre: <strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"806\">Shooter / RPG / Online multiplayer</strong><br data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"809\">Aantal spelers: <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"855\">1 (offline), tot 16 online</strong><br data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"858\">Taal: <strong data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"916\">Nederlands beschikbaar (menu’s en ondertiteling)</strong><br data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"919\">Leeftijd: <strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"940\">PEGI 16</strong><br data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"943\">Verpakking: <strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"985\">Originele hoes meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1047\"><strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1047\"><em data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1045\">Incl. 1 maand garantie op werking en leesbaarheid</em></strong></p>",
